 height=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"imgWithMessage-img\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimg%2FimagenesNosotros%2FimagenPortada.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"imgWithMessage-text\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><h1 class=\"imgWithMessage-text-title\">CONOCE A NUESTRO \n<span class=\"imgWithMessage-text-title-highligh\">GRAN EQUIPO</span></h1></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-underTitle\"></p></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-subtitle\"></p></div><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-description\"></p><nav class=\"imgWithMessage-text-buttons\"></nav></div></section><section class=\"teamShowCase \" id=\"#teamShowCaseInicio\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-container\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-text\"><p class=\"teamShowCase-text-subTitle\">¿Qué es Inversiones D&amp;C?</p><h2 class=\"teamShowCase-text-title\"><span class=\"teamShowCase-text-title-highligh\">INVERSIONES D&amp;C </span></h2><div class=\"teamShowCase-text-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"teamShowCase-text-description\">Inversiones D&amp;C es un Operador Logístico Internacional que brinda soluciones de logística y comercio internacional, facilitando la importación de mercancías hacia el Perú. Acompañamos a nuestros clientes en cada etapa del proceso, ofreciendo un servicio seguro, eficiente y confiable.</p></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-imgRight\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-imgRight-img\" alt=\"Equipo de Inversiones D&amp;C\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/imagenNosotros.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"teamPersonsList \"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-down \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><h2 class=\"teamPersonsList-title\">NUESTRO EQUIPO</h2></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-down \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamPersonsList-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><ul class=\"teamPersonsList-container\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:200ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Daisy Clerque encargado de: CEO Fundadora\" src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/imagenTeam2.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Daisy Clerque</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">CEO Fundadora</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:400ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Cristina Gonzales encargado de: Gerente General\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/CRISTINA.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Cristina Gonzales</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Gerente General</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:600ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Yudith Chambilla encargado de: Ejecutiva Comercial\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/YUDITH.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Yudith Chambilla</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Ejecutiva Comercial</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:800ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Sandra Rojas encargado de: Ejecutiva Comercial\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/SANDRA.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Sandra Rojas</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Ejecutiva Comercial</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:1000ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Nicole Huauya encargado de: Customer Service\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/NICOLE.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Nicole Huauya</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Customer Service</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:1200ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Ingrid Meneses encargado de: Área de Operaciones\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/INGRID.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Ingrid Meneses</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Área de Operaciones</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:1400ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Roberto Fuentes encargado de: Área de Operaciones\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/ROBERTO.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Roberto Fuentes</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Área de Operaciones</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:1600ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-img\" alt=\"Fotografía de Andrea Moscoso encargado de: Ejecutiva Comercial\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/ANDREA.jpg\"/><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">Andrea Moscoso</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Ejecutiva Comercial</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:1800ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person\" style=\"align-self:start\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-avatar-container\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-avatar\">CG</div></div><h3 class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-name\">César Gonzales</h3><p class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs-person-position\">Desarrollador Web</p></li></div></ul></section><section class=\"imgWithHighLigths \"><div class=\"imgWithHighLigths-container\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-fade \" style=\"--animation-displacement:60px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><img class=\"imgWithHighLigths-img\" src=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/imagenMisionVisionValores.jpg\" alt=\"Foto Grupal del equipo de Inversiones D&amp;C\"/></div><ul class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:200ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item\"><h3 class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-title\"><i class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-icon fa fa-solid fa-bullseye\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>NUESTRA MISIÓN</h3><p class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-description\">Facilitar el proceso de importación y comercio internacional de nuestros clientes, brindando soluciones logísticas integrales y acompañamiento durante cada etapa, desde la coordinación con proveedores hasta la llegada y entrega de su mercancía en el Perú.</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:400ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item\"><h3 class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-title\"><i class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-icon fa fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>NUESTRA VISIÓN</h3><p class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-description\">Consolidarnos como una empresa líder en soluciones de logística y comercio internacional, reconocida por nuestra confianza, eficiencia y compromiso, conectando a nuestros clientes con oportunidades comerciales en mercados globales.</p></li></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:600ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item\"><h3 class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-title\"><i class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-icon fa fa-regular fa-heart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>NUESTROS VALORES</h3><p class=\"imgWithHighLights-cards-item-description\">Confianza, compromiso y transparencia en cada operación, ofreciendo un acompañamiento cercano y responsable para brindar a nuestros clientes seguridad y tranquilidad durante todo su proceso de importación.</p></li></div></ul></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"footer \"><div class=\"footer-firstPart\"><div class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo\"><img src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/logoBlanco.png\" alt=\"Logo de Inversiones D&amp;C\" class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo-img\"/><p class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo-description\">Somos Inversiones D&amp;C, un Operador Logístico Internacional con presencia en Europa, Asia y Latinoamérica. Ofrecemos soluciones de logística y comercio internacional para realizar importaciones de forma segura y eficiente.</p><div class=\"footer-firstPart-socials\"><h3 class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-title\"></h3><ul class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list\"><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/InversionesDyCPeru/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-facebook\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/inversionesdycsac/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DycInversiones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-twitter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://pe.linkedin.com/company/inversionesdyc-peru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\